<String id="170350" string="Skill Manual: Moon Lotus Aura" toolTip="Use this manual to learn how to enshroud yourself in a radiant lotus aura. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Activate the Moon Lotus Aura to receive the Moon Lotus Blessing for 15 minutes. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color = '#41FF3A'&gt;[Effect]&lt;/font&gt; Completely restores your HP and MP, increases your attack speed by $H_W_GOOD5$COLOR_END and your movement speed in combat by $H_W_GOOD5$COLOR_END.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;$H_W_BADBlessing cooldown: 30 minutes$COLOR_END&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The aura disappears when you enter combat, the blessing remains." />
