<String id="201245" string="Skill Manual: Star Lotus Aura" toolTip="Use this manual to learn how to enshroud yourself in a radiant lotus aura. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Activate the Star Lotus Aura to receive the Star Lotus Blessing for 15 minutes. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;font color = '#41FF3A'&gt;[Effect]&lt;/font&gt; Completely restores your HP and MP, increases your attack speed by $H_W_GOOD3$COLOR_END and your movement speed in combat by $H_W_GOOD5$COLOR_END.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;$H_W_BADBlessing cooldown: 30 minutes$COLOR_END&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;The aura disappears when you enter combat, the blessing remains." />
